    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d444">

                <pb facs="0425" n="343" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg343"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the American
                        Minister.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-06-22"><hi rendition="#italic">June 22,
                        1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Falkner’s appointment received and delivered. To avoid possible misunderstanding,
                    his designation and powers should be described in commission as quoted in
                    Department’s cable of June 18. Inform Liberian Government.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
